author born city grew up another author International Booker Prize winner\", \"International Booker Prize winner born same city another author grew up\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_8e1f78de6b3a4a928f7f11a1","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d3\"},\"ref\":\"d3\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2016, the award was significantly reconfigured, and is now given annually to a single book in English translation, with a £50,000 prize for the winning title, shared equally between author and translator. The award has been known as the International Booker Prize since the Man Group ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... Grayling (chair) *Sarah Churchwell *Jonathan Bate *Dr Daniel Glaser *Dr Alastair Niven *Erica Wagner |\\n| 2014 The Booker Prizes |url= |url-status=live |archive-url= |archive-date=29 March 2023 |access-date=2022-10-19 |website=thebookerprizes.com |language=en}} | Longlist | Richard Powers | Orfeo | Atlantic Books | *A. C. Grayling ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d35\"},\"ref\":\"d35\",\"snippet\":\" ... This year brings a record for the longest period between an original-language publication and International Booker prize longlisting. On a Woman's Madness by Astrid Roemer was first published in Dutch 43 years ago, and is now translated into English by Lucy Scott.\\n