vious-raymond-carver-reading-series/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d39\"},\"ref\":\"d39\",\"snippet\":\" ... a Finalist for Translated Literature in 2018 and Longlisted in 2019. The authors and translators on the list have been recognized by numerous international prizes, including the Akutagawa Prize, the Prix de la Littérature Arabe, the International Booker Prize, and the PEN Translation Prize. Their work has appeared ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nationalbook.org/2022-national-book-awards-longlist-for-translated-literature/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d40\"},\"ref\":\"d40\",\"snippet\":\" ... Ondaatje's Warlight is in contention with 12 other longlisted titles by American, British, Irish, and Canadian authors.The best-recognized and most-honored literary fiction prize in the English language, the Man Booker Prize for Fiction—not to be confused with the translation-focused Man Booker International ... \",\"title\":\"https://publishingperspectives.com/2018/07/man-booker-prize-fiction-longlist-2018-announced-london/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"e879669d224244beaade05b0515d84e6338dee0bb3ab5e212e02be09e084dc9f\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"b49913036e41688e12dbe9d61e4d9e5fb173ef8c70bf6c07f064470827bc87a1\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"International Booker Prize longlist book translated 25 languages 2010s\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d41\"},\"ref\":\"d41\",\"sn