nneur ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julian_Barnes\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"32a258bc28e90a2148b4d3aa8916437f41c876db33d33c8995ecad844cef45b7\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"d209eee09232a2d68c2a59704cb686d56537222cb51657f5b7280821b73f56dd\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"book translated over 25 languages shortlisted Man Booker International\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_b6a0484ccca94cb98de36e9b"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d50\"},\"ref\":\"d50\",\"snippet\":\" ... Daniel Halpern was born in Syracuse, New York, grew up in Los Angeles and Seattle, and has lived in Tangier, Morocco, New York City and Princeton. He is the author of nine collections of poetry, most recently Something Shining. For 25 years, Halpern edited the international literary magazine ... \",\"title\":\"https://centerforfiction.org/grants-awards/medal-for-editorial-excellence/medal-for-editorial-excellence-past-recipients/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d33\"},\"ref\":\"d33\",\"snippet\":\" ... Nneka Arimah was born in the UK and grew up in Nigeria and wherever else her father was stationed for work. She has been a finalist for a National Magazine Award and the Caine Prize, and a winner of the African Commonwealth Short Story Prize and an O ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.aspeninstitute.org/blog-posts/20-new-works-fiction-social-impact/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d45\"},\"ref\":\"d45\",\"snippet\":\" ... Fiammetta has been the judge of numerous prizes for fiction and non-fiction, and is the administrator of the International Booker Prize. Of Franco-Italian origin, she grew up in Kenya and read Arabic at Oxford University. Her book, The Miraculous Fever Tree, about malaria and the discovery ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.oxbelly.com/fiction-writers-program/advisors\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... Eleanor Frances Catton\\n\\nEleanor Catton (born 1985) is a New Zealand novelist and screenwriter. Born in Canada, Catton moved to New Zealand as a child and grew up in Christchurch. She completed a master's degree in creative writing at the International Institute of Modern Letters. Her award ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eleanor_Catton\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d41\"},\"ref\":\"d41\",\"snippet\":\" ... Bring Up the Bodies also won the Booker Prize in 2012.\\n\\nHilary Mantel is a U.K.-born historical fiction writer and is one of the few authors to have won the Booker Prize twice. She is the author of 14 books, including A Place of Greater Safety ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/30-books-to-celebrate-30-years-of-writers-company-1.5755144\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d38\"},\"ref\":\"d38\",\"snippet\":\" ... MacArthur Foundation (used with permission)\\n\\nValeria Luiselli was born in Mexico City and grew up in South Korea, South Africa, and India. The recipient of a 2020 Guggenheim Fellowship and a 2019 MacArthur Fellowship, she is the author of the novels Faces in the Crowd, The Story of ... \",\"title\":\"https://artsandsciences.syracuse.edu/english-department/creative-writing-mf-program/raymond-carver-reading-series/previous-raymond-carver-reading-series/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d42\"},\"ref\":\"d42\",\"snippet\":\" ... Tom Flood was born in Sydney in New South Wales, the son of writer Dorothy Hewett and grew up in Western Australia. His first novel Oceana Fine won the 1988 Australian/Vogel Literary Award, the 1990 Miles Franklin Award and the 1990 Vance Palmer Prize for Fiction. He ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goodreads.com/topic/show/22141667-winners-of-the-miles-franklin-literary-award\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d52\"},\"ref\":\"d52\",\"snippet\":\" ... Booker Prize, the International Booker Prize, PEN America Literary Awards, and the National Book Award.\\n\\nThese awards are highly coveted, being recognized globally by authors alike across all genres.\\n\\nGet a Custom Author Website\\n\\nWe built all of these sites ☝️\\n\\nCategory-Specific Book Awards and Recent Winners\\n\\nFiction ... \",\"title\":\"https://rocketexpansion.com/book-awards/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"af9841adb377ee91dbf87a089a4501fc9fa8b41afa5e8619b019b33a5c453b56\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"6017b0c75a169f4f2eb1eca3f9411da15141e84704de5ba747cf5d5249ee8b6e\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"author born city grew up another author International Booker Prize winner\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navig